cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ANZSRC FoR 2020 classifier: research field groups from title and abstract"
abstract: >-
  Data cleaning pipeline, source-grouped evaluation and an ensemble of TF-IDF, SPECTER2 and ModernBERT-large
  that assigns ANZSRC Fields of Research 2020 groups (213 groups, 23 divisions) to research publications
  from their title and abstract.
authors:
  - family-names: Korkos
    given-names: Yaroslav
type: software
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-11-09
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yaroslavandds/anzsrc-for-classifier"
keywords:
  - ANZSRC
  - Fields of Research
  - text classification
  - multi-label classification
  - scientific documents
  - SPECTER2
  - ModernBERT
